OL,3,GNEWSARolls-Royce incident prompts
OL,4,Aemergency response
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have advised people in the
OL,7,FAlvaston area of Derby to keep their
OL,8,Fwindows and doors closed while
OL,9,Femergency services deal with the
OL,10,Fincident.
